  FP[speed]: 'Massively FTL+ (Superior to Iris, who can fly at this speed. Should be superior to mid-game Sveta, who has an Unleash attack that moves across galaxies within seconds), possibly Infinite (Should be superior in speed to Chasm, who embodies the endless void.)'
  FP[range]: 'Tens of meters with hand-to-hand combat and standard weapon attacks, hundreds of meters with Unleashes, Interstellar range with summons, Universal+ range with Psynergy and Alchemy'
  FP[intelligence]: "Genius. Isaac was revered by Alex as being one of the greatest minds when it came to solving the mysteries of the Lighthouses. Saturos and Menardi manipulated Isaac into figuring out the secrets of Sol Sanctum because they couldn't do it. Isaac has solved the puzzles of many other dungeons. Isaac is skilled in many forms of combat encompassing classes such as Gladiator, Illusionist, Master, Ronin, Paladin, Beast Tamer, Necromancer, Acrobat, and many other things. Isaac has mastered many forms of weaponry after picking them up for the first time, such as swords, maces, axes, bombs, and Jenei artifacts, and he is also notably skilled in javelins, whips, fans, shuriken, and tridents. He is a skilled sailor without ever having needed anyone to teach him how to use the Lemurian ship with Psynergy, and he even knew how to fly it without having ever practiced Hover before. He is known for being a skilled warrior by Kaja who claimed after only seeing him that he had seen more combat than he will ever know. He was so much better at fighting than the Colosso warriors that they believed he cheated and that the fight was rigged. He studied Psynergy and Alchemy for many years under Kraden, one of the greatest scholars of such subjects in the world. Isaac is capable of choreographing everything that happens in battle as a leader, telling everyone what to do, all without using any words at all."
  FP[tier]: 'Low 2-C'
